                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "module",
                  "description": "(Required) Module name, e.g. `rules_python`, `rules_go`, `protobuf`."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "version",
                  "description": "(Required) Module version string. Bazel uses an extended SemVer ordering that also tolerates suffixes such as `1.2.3.bcr.1`."
